  <notes>
    <note>
      <text>## Source modeler (CRM)

Import schema from CRM, refine relationships, then define **source queries** and **Source JSON**.

The query **All customer info** joins hub + address + contact + demo + prefs.
Publish it (toolbar or context menu) as catalog feed `feed_customer_enriched`.

**order_shipment_event** simulates a Kafka consumer (UUID + JSON payload + topic/partition/offset).
Source JSON **order_shipment_tracking** flattens the payload — publish as `feed_order_shipment_tracking`.

See docs/source-modeler-overview.adoc.
</text>
